{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-lufeiya-electric-tricycle-2606-0269","content_id":"b3cbc16a-29a7-4f91-bd54-855ab3c3950d","description":"Product Safety Report for Lufeiya Electric Tricycle presenting a serious risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"779696c4-0e55-4a99-a13a-0ad120d34a7c","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-17T14:58:32+01:00","id":"779696c4-0e55-4a99-a13a-0ad120d34a7c","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-17T14:58:32+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a8313880ad4bc475be7df4b/2606-0269-product-safety-report-lufeiya-electric-tricycle.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Lufeiya Electric Tricycle</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of fire as it is supplied with a noncompliant charger.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment - Cycles (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Lufeiya</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product identifiers</td>\n      <td>ZYGJ00326020300210, 66020260203001-5</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Charger</td>\n      <td>48V3A</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>An electric tricycle wall battery pack and charging power supply.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_779696c4-0e55-4a99-a13a-0ad120d34a7c\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a8313880ad4bc475be7df4b/2606-0269-product-safety-report-lufeiya-electric-tricycle.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of fire because it is supplied with a two-pin plug that cannot incorporate a fuse and therefore does not meet the requirements of BS 1363. In the event of a fault or overcurrent, there is no adequate protection, which may lead to overheating and a risk of fire. Additionally, improvements are required to the documentation, markings, and instruction manual. A valid Declaration of Conformity was not supplied with the product.   </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008 or Plugs &amp; Sockets etc. (Safety) Regulations 1994.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2606-0269</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-17T13:59:08Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-17","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-17T14:59:08+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-lufeiya-electric-tricycle-2606-0269","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/a